ion":7,"messages":["I've had some exciting experiences! On November 14, 2025, I spoke at a conference. Then on January 15, 2026, I ran the marathon. And just so you know, I've switched from techno to indie rock for music."],"conveyed":["s7f0","s7f1","s7f2"]}]}
